Z||000005||Phantom Rage||03-20-2001||03:19 AM||||I can't wait, but spring break traffic on A1A suck right about now.  I just visited my parents there, as well as helping to break in my friends new 2002 Subaru WRX Impreza Turbo <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Can you say FAST!!!<P>The weather might not be too good for a car show, since it has been raining for a few days here, but I have to say we really need it, so don't wish it away ok <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Yes there is a Krispy Kream; it is on the corner of International Speed Way and Nova road.  It's just across for the Daytona Mall, which is pretty run down and not to be confused with the Volusia Mall.<P>I hope everyone has a safe trip and a good time.<P>||||reg||7
