Z||000007||Songman||03-20-2001||11:39 PM||||Nope... nothing is going right, Cheever. I'm not even gonna get to come to Daytona now.<P>The Indy is still with Doug in West Virgina, because the Formula is still with Ed in Alabama.<P>The 88 is still sitting out here with a broken cam gear because I haven't gotten the 3800SC yet.<P>The Aerocoupe Monte Carlo is still not put back together yet... why? I don't know.. Too many other things going on, I guess...<P>And now, I am even booked in the studio that weekend so can't make it anyway.<P>Oh well.. I still hope to get to meet all of you guys at some point. I travel a lot so who knows?!? hehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
